---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="AI Automation"
  description="Custom AI workflows and automation systems that augment creative teams. EvansMathibe builds intelligent systems for advertising, media, and design professionals."
  image="/logo.png"
>
  <section id="ai-automation" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 md:mb-20">
      <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">AI Automation</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Intelligent Systems That Amplify Creativity</h2>
      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-[#DE656D] mx-auto mt-6 rounded-full"></div>
      <p class="section-subtitle mt-6">We don't replace creatives with AI — we build systems that give them back their time, energy, and creative capacity.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 glow-primary relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-[#DE656D]/5 rounded-full -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">The Core Thesis</p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Augment, Don't Replace</h3>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">Every AI system we build is designed to handle the repetitive, the computational, and the scalable — so human creatives can focus on what they do best: the original, the intuitive, and the deeply human.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Services Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
      <div class="glass-card group">
        <div class="service-icon group-hover:bg-[#DE656D]/20">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Workflow Automation</h3>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Automate repetitive tasks across advertising production, media scheduling, and design iteration pipelines. Reduce manual work by up to 60%.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="text-[#DE656D] font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2 group/link hover:gap-3 transition-all">Explore →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card group">
        <div class="service-icon group-hover:bg-[#DE656D]/20">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">AI-Powered Content Generation</h3>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Scale content production without sacrificing quality. AI-assisted ideation, copy generation, and visual mockup creation that maintains brand voice.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="text-[#DE656D] font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2 group/link hover:gap-3 transition-all">Explore →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card group">
        <div class="service-icon group-hover:bg-[#DE656D]/20">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Custom AI Integrations</h3>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Build proprietary AI systems tailored to your existing tools and workflows. Connect GPT models, image generators, and data pipelines into one cohesive system.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="text-[#DE656D] font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2 group/link hover:gap-3 transition-all">Explore →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card group">
        <div class="service-icon group-hover:bg-[#DE656D]/20">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Process Optimization</h3>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Audit and optimize creative team processes using AI-driven insights. Identify bottlenecks, predict resource needs, and accelerate delivery timelines.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="text-[#DE656D] font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2 group/link hover:gap-3 transition-all">Explore →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Results Section -->
    <div class="bg-[#111111] rounded-2xl border border-white/5 p-8 md:p-12 mb-16">
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">Measurable Impact</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-2">40%</p>
          <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Reduction in design iteration time</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-2">60%</p>
          <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Less manual repetitive work</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-2">3x</p>
          <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Faster content production cycles</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Ready to Build Your AI System?</h3>
      <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">Tell us about your team's biggest bottleneck and we'll show you how AI can help.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary text-lg px-10 py-4">Start Your Automation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>